{"agent":"recover-lk","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":2,"detail":"The new `pre_tool` entry in `INSTALLED` is indexed directly later by `hk.events[event]`. For any harness whose descriptor lacks a `pre_tool` event—four of 23 according to the change's own description—this raises `KeyError: 'pre_tool'` while generating or installing that harness's hooks, instead of printing that the hook is unavailable and falling back to the commit-time check.","digest":"1f63425512c79e4b","family":"deepseek","location":"ddflow/services/hookwriters/__init__.py:41","reviewer":"lan-deepseek-v4-pro","severity":"HIGH","title":"ddflow/services/hookwriters/__init__.py:41"},{"chunk":3,"detail":"This test assumes the default `[locks].mode` is `enforce`, but it never sets `DDFLOW_LOCKS_MODE=enforce` or clears `DDFLOW_LOCKS_MODE`. Since the file itself uses `DDFLOW_LOCKS_MODE` as a supported knob, running the suite with `DDFLOW_LOCKS_MODE=off` makes `AS.hooks` return `allowed` for the out-of-lease write, so `assert out.data[\"result\"] == \"denied\"` fails. The test is not isolated from a valid supported environment setting.","digest":"ba629c70dfa6ffce","family":"deepseek","location":"tests/test_write_hook_wire.py:30 test_mode_enforce_refuses_a_write_outside_the_lease","reviewer":"lan-deepseek-v4-pro","severity":"LOW","title":"tests/test_write_hook_wire.py:30 test_mode_enforce_refuses_a_write_outside_the_lease"},{"chunk":2,"detail":"`_holder` wraps the entire lease scan in one `try`, so one unreadable lease drops every later holder, not just that clause. Given a snapshot whose first lease has `renewed_at=\"not-a-timestamp\"` (or `renewed_at`/`ttl_s` set to null) and a later live lease `{holder: \"agent-2\", globs: [\"src/b.py\"], renewed_at: now, ttl_s: 3600}`, `float(...)`/`int(...)` raises, the handler returns `\"\"`, and `verdict` refuses `src/b.py` without naming agent-2.","digest":"e978cd076104e572","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/services/swarm/lanehooks_check.py:88","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/swarm/lanehooks_check.py:88"},{"chunk":2,"detail":"`_first_holder` attaches one holder to the whole refused list. A multi-path write `[\"src/a.py\", \"src/b.py\"]` where only `src/b.py` is inside agent-2's live globs yields `lane …: src/a.py, src/b.py is outside the item's lease globs (…) and agent-2 holds it`, which is false for `src/a.py` and tells the caller to wait on the wrong file.","digest":"31956775f29e9ba0","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/services/swarm/lanehooks_check.py:147","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"LOW","title":"ddflow/services/swarm/lanehooks_check.py:147"}],"chunks_total":2,"coverage":"2/2 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":1,"diff_chars":14413,"diff_sha":"51da0cb4b0290204529b1f7b108778f863d748d648597deb2692e31d8ac4c578","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":1.4,"excluded_bytes":2615,"excluded_files":1,"excluded_paths":["README.md"],"family":"deepseek","findings":4,"max_chunk_chars":12000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"f47775fc16c641a3","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/LK-write-hook-wire.critic.gemini-3.5-flash-lite.20261107T225745Z-4d6d11e7.jsonl","reason":"","review_degraded":[{"at":1794091845.1094813,"family":"moonshot","gate":"critic","model":"kimi-for-coding-highspeed","reason":"HTTP 429","reviewer":"kimi-k3"}],"review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2],"reviewed_head":"8f58704d286289fa6885384113edf95414113da1","reviewed_paths":{"README.md":"100644 fe6db45d0972fff80f7326ab9554856bf9955394","ddflow/api/setup/hooks.py":"100644 8fe752cebfdc0049735f21eab4b6b0452c93f9bc","ddflow/config_sections/locks.py":"100644 4f536f49c90898761e24d083f926d05072d92cfc","ddflow/services/claudehooks.py":"100644 b47972a24dde0a4098cef33512913631de8806f1","ddflow/services/hookwriters/__init__.py":"100644